  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>For athletic style as legendary as a winged horse, look no farther than Nike’s P-6000. This revolutionary shoe combines features from the Pegasus 25 and the Pegasus 2006 for a truly unique design. Leather, textile, and synthetic materials form a striking upper, while a foam midsole cushions each and every step.</p> <ul> <li>Upper shows off breathable mesh with vertical and horizontal overlays.</li> <li>Cushioned sock-liner provides comfortable support underfoot.</li> <li>Foam midsole offers lightweight cushioning.</li> <li>Rubber outsole provides durability, traction, and grip.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Long days on your feet call for comfort that still looks put together. The Nike P-6000 blends early-2000s running DNA from the Pegasus 25 and Pegasus 2006 into an everyday sneaker that feels light, cushioned, and easy to wear from workouts to weekend plans.</p><ul><li>Breathable mesh upper with vertical and horizontal overlays for a layered retro runner look</li><li>Cushioned sockliner helps add soft support underfoot</li><li>Foam midsole delivers lightweight comfort for daily wear</li><li>Rubber outsole adds durable traction and grip</li></ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say the fit is true to size. For the best fit, we recommend ordering your usual size, with the shape offering enough room for many shoppers who prefer a little extra space through the forefoot.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for all-day walking, travel, errands, light gym sessions, and everyday athleisure wear.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p><p>The layered design gives the P-6000 that standout retro running look while still feeling easy to style. It pairs naturally with leggings, denim, joggers, and casual workday fits when you want sporty comfort without sacrificing looks.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p><p>Many reviewers say the P-6000 feels comfortable right out of the box, with little to no break-in needed. The mixed-material upper and rubber outsole are built to handle frequent rotation for walking, commuting, and everyday wear.</p> <p><strong>Care & Maintenance</strong></p><p>To keep them looking fresh, clean the mesh and overlays with a soft brush or cloth and mild soap. Some reviewers also note that the shoe is easy to clean, which makes it a strong pick for regular wear.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike P-6000 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/White/Mica Green</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>IM9013-101</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: